  "note": "Filename says 'unknown'. The page finishes the 2023-2024 Lunenburg High School Staff Roster begun on page 138 (Special Services, paraprofessionals, athletics, media, guidance, cafeteria, custodians), so school = high. Mostly bare-name columns with no role printed: most 'headings' on this page are role labels standing over a single person ('Athletic Director' over Kevin Bigelow, 'Athletic/Secretary' over Courtney Fuller, 'Media Specialist' over Pamela Vallee, 'Guidance Secretary' over Patricia Foster, 'Cafeteria Manager' over John Terho, 'Head Custodian' over Renee Lafontaine). Those people are recorded with role_raw '' and the label in grade_or_dept, per the column rule. Lines 10-12 are the exception -- they print name and role side by side in the left column ('Stacey Canfield / Social Worker', 'Mary Young / BCBA', 'Lori Shea / School Psych') -- and those roles are in role_raw. THE LEGEND: line 16 prints '*Department Head' in the left column. It is the legend for the asterisks on this page and on page 138, and it is recorded in ignored; line 16 itself is an entry line because the right column carries Jonathan Ciullo. Asterisked names keep the asterisk as printed in name and carry role_raw '*'. LIKELY READINGS, all recorded exactly as printed: line 19 'KimberlyPoli-Monsin' is missing its space and is probably 'Kimberly Poli-Monsin'; line 20 'amantha Collye' has lost its leading and trailing letters and is probably 'Samantha Collyer'; line 28 'Dana i Marbre' has a stray character and is probably 'Dana LaMarbre' or 'Dana Marbre'. Renee Lafontaine also appears on page 134 as the Middle School custodian, Pamela Vallee on page 138 under Unified Arts, and Mary Young and Lori Shea on page 134 as the Middle School behaviorist and psychologist -- shared staff.",
